@startuml 05-state-payment
title State Diagram - Payment Life Cycle (brief section 2.5)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass\nand wallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails\nor funds insufficient

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms\n(or TopUpNet callback "success")
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within 10 s\n(or no callback within wait time)

Unknown --> Completed : later confirmation\n(callback, re-query, settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses,\nor reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Money stays HELD.
  Re-query at +1, +5, +15 min,
  then wait for reconciliation.
  Never refunded automatically.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Final states: Completed, Rejected, Refunded.
  Refund of a Completed payment (US-28) is a
  separate refund request, not a state change.
end note
@enduml